## 2. EnrollOnlyInEnrollMode path, replayed on enrollInCourse (courseEnrollment.ts:28-38)

step 1: student taps Enroll; the call reads the course in enroll mode
step 2: admin sets Paid course (course saved isFree=false)
step 3: the enrollment is saved while the course mode is now "paid"
enrollInCourse returned kind=enrolled; CourseEnrollment rows: 1
then, still Paid: play false, tab none (the stray row grants and lists nothing)
admin sets Free, enroll to unlock again: play true, tab Free

## 3. EnrollTab / PaidTab paths with ENFORCE_ORDER_EXPIRY on

enroll, not enrolled, order none   : play no , tab none
enroll, not enrolled, order active : play yes, tab Free
enroll, not enrolled, order expired: play no , tab Free

paid, not enrolled, order none   : play no , tab none
paid, not enrolled, order active : play yes, tab Paid
paid, not enrolled, order expired: play no , tab Paid

